[
  {
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "9351ef1a-81bb-5fe9-a584-30bce7bebf8f",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\sec{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{y} \\right)}.\n$$\n\nIf the transformation $y=v(x)x$ is applied to the differential equation, what is the resulting equation?",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Using the transformation $y=vx$ (where $v=v(x)$), we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(x) \\\\  & =x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the given differential equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\sec{\\left(\\frac{3 x}{y} \\right)} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v & =\\sec{\\left(\\frac{3}{v} \\right)} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v & =\\sec{\\left(\\frac{3}{v} \\right)} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x} & =- v + \\sec{\\left(\\frac{3}{v} \\right)} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x} & =- v + \\sec{\\left(\\frac{3}{v} \\right)} \\\\ \\left(- \\frac{1}{v - \\sec{\\left(\\frac{3}{v} \\right)}}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{1}{x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "a06db494-e8ab-50f0-85e8-0dee77fe842f",
          ":answer-field/key": "selection",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/radio",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "71e9e715-034a-5346-a983-76cb1e65f412",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "\\left(\\frac{1}{\\sec{\\left(\\frac{3}{v} \\right)}}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "222ed251-d59c-5b71-bf92-8df1b07304db",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "\\left(\\frac{1}{v + \\sec{\\left(\\frac{3}{v} \\right)}}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "c1852ecd-3285-5b1c-b3d2-03f34c56feba",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "\\left(- \\frac{1}{2 v - \\sec{\\left(\\frac{3}{v} \\right)}}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "39333416-b4ac-5175-ab95-e651a769259c",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "\\left(\\frac{1}{2 v + \\sec{\\left(\\frac{3}{v} \\right)}}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "03afa229-9a41-5c22-9411-8364668ca926",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "\\left(- \\frac{1}{v - \\sec{\\left(\\frac{3}{v} \\right)}}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}"
            }
          ],
          ":answer-field/correct": [
            ":answer/id",
            "03afa229-9a41-5c22-9411-8364668ca926"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
