  {
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "3e6c456c-6b0f-5be2-84bc-1822852cf130",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=- 4 \\sin{\\left(\\frac{y}{x} \\right)} + \\frac{3 y}{x}.\n$$\n\nIf the transformation $y=v(x)x$ is applied to the differential equation, what is the resulting equation?",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Using the transformation $y=vx$ (where $v=v(x)$), we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(x) \\\\  & =x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the given differential equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =- 4 \\sin{\\left(\\frac{y}{x} \\right)} + \\frac{3 y}{x} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v & =3 v - 4 \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v & =3 v - 4 \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x} & =2 v - 4 \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x} & =2 v - 4 \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\\\ \\left(\\frac{1}{2 v - 4 \\sin{\\left(v \\right)}}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{1}{x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "da440c92-c3e1-51c1-b416-c6c165089658",
          ":answer-field/key": "selection",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/radio",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "e9ab3f67-e86b-516d-b5d7-2914aba89f49",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "\\left(- \\frac{1}{4 \\sin{\\left(v \\right)}}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "acefd42b-0e65-5986-85c1-bd2a7fed5eaf",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "\\left(\\frac{1}{v - 4 \\sin{\\left(v \\right)}}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "aee8d14f-831f-57e2-8fed-85ed86586822",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "\\left(\\frac{1}{2 v - 4 \\sin{\\left(v \\right)}}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "1e710340-2c0e-5cee-99d0-1db523ca1ea5",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "\\left(- \\frac{1}{v + 4 \\sin{\\left(v \\right)}}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "133041c6-4548-5215-b863-279d3c28d4a4",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "\\left(- \\frac{1}{2 v + 4 \\sin{\\left(v \\right)}}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}"
            }
          ],
          ":answer-field/correct": [
