  {
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "527659a3-5b5c-572c-a40a-40f7aa4a46d1",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{3 x^{2} - x y + y^{2}}{x^{2} + y^{2}}.\n$$\n\nIf the transformation $y=v(x)x$ is applied to the differential equation, what is the resulting equation?",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Using the transformation $y=vx$ (where $v=v(x)$), we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(x) \\\\  & =x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the given differential equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{3 x^{2} - x y + y^{2}}{x^{2} + y^{2}} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v & =\\frac{v^{2} x^{2} - v x^{2} + 3 x^{2}}{v^{2} x^{2} + x^{2}} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}+v & =\\frac{v^{2} - v + 3}{v^{2} + 1} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x} & =- v + \\frac{v^{2} - v + 3}{v^{2} + 1} \\\\ x\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{- v^{3} + v^{2} - 2 v + 3}{v^{2} + 1} \\\\ \\left(\\frac{- v^{2} - 1}{v^{3} - v^{2} + 2 v - 3}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{1}{x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "4f500c66-8554-5428-98ca-c74e346629b6",
          ":answer-field/key": "selection",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/radio",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "8699e11e-2296-50b2-88d9-bc074e617db7",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "\\left(\\frac{v^{2} + 1}{v^{2} - v + 3}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "13566fa7-97d4-532c-a2ba-cd60b57eee19",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "\\left(\\frac{- v^{2} - 1}{v^{3} - v^{2} + 2 v - 3}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "06d33ea7-b543-59f6-b14a-645157fb671d",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "\\left(\\frac{v^{2} + 1}{v^{3} + v^{2} + 3}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "a2de75f4-a863-5c01-8b35-58e6f1e78863",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "\\left(\\frac{- v^{2} - 1}{3 v^{3} - v^{2} + 4 v - 3}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "c93a8f8d-6a48-5813-9d27-316fe3cb6a08",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "\\left(\\frac{- v^{2} - 1}{2 v^{3} - v^{2} + 3 v - 3}\\right)\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}"
            }
          ],
          ":answer-field/correct": [
            ":answer/id",
            "13566fa7-97d4-532c-a2ba-cd60b57eee19"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
